From: Przemek Klosowski <przemek@rrdjazz.nist.gov>
Subject: Re: /sbin/route and 2.1.20 kernel

/sbin/ifconfig lo ...
	/sbin/route add -net 127.0.0.0 netmask 255.0.0.0 dev lo
	/sbin/ifconfig eth0 ...
	/sbin/route add -net a.b.c.0 netmask 255.255.255.0 dev eth0

   Now the warning messages disappeared on both the Jensen and the 486.
   But now I can only access hosts on our local net, but not hosts on
   the internet.

You have to tell your computer how to reach the gateway to get to the
outside world:

	/sbin/route add default gw  your.gateway's.IP

	

