The installation program tries to mount RedHat/instimage, from which
it gets its executables in RedHat/instimage/bin and some lib stuff
in RedHat/instimage/lib.  Please check if the subdirectory RedHat/instimage
is, in fact, in your NFS server, and check if the binaries in 
RedHat/instimage/bin have the correct execute permissions.

